# 📝 React To-Do List

A simple and responsive To-Do List application built using **React.js** and **Tailwind CSS**. It helps users manage daily tasks by adding, deleting, and marking tasks as completed. Tasks are saved using browser localStorage, so they remain available even after refreshing the page.

## ✨ Features

- ➕ **Add Tasks:** Add new tasks to your list.
- 🗑️ **Delete Tasks:** Remove tasks whenever needed.
- ✅ **Mark as Completed:** Mark tasks as completed or pending using checkboxes.
- 💾 **Local Storage:** Automatically saves tasks and preserves them after browser refresh.
- 📊 **Progress Tracking:** Displays completed tasks and remaining tasks.
- 📱 **Responsive Design:** Clean and responsive UI using Tailwind CSS.
- ⌨️ **Keyboard Support:** Press Enter to add a task.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- React.js
- JavaScript (ES6+)
- Tailwind CSS
- HTML5
- Vite
- Browser localStorage

